{"slug":"morgan-griffith","qid":"Q1684857","name":"Morgan Griffith","desc":"U.S.A Representative from Virginia","article":"Morgan Griffith","born":"1958-03-15","died":null,"birthplace":"Philadelphia","parties":["Republican Party"],"offices":[{"t":"U.S. Representative","w":"VA-09","f":2011,"u":null},{"t":"Virginia House of Delegates","w":"","f":1994,"u":2010}],"summary":"Howard Morgan Griffith (born March 15, 1958) is an American politician and lawyer serving as the U.S. representative for Virginia's 9th congressional district since 2011. A member of the Republican Party, his district covers the majority of rural Southwest Virginia, including the New River Valley and the Virginia side of the Tri-Cities.\nGriffith was the majority leader of the Virginia House of Delegates and represented the 8th district from 1994 to 2011.","photo":{"f":"morgan-griffith.jpg","by":"Brendan O'Hara, U.S. House of Representatives Creative Services","lic":"Public domain","licUrl":null,"page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:H._Morgan_Griffith_119th_Congress.jpg"},"history":[{"y":2026,"o":"H","k":"VA-09","p":"R","n":"Morgan Griffith","race":"VA-09"},{"y":2024,"o":"H","k":"VA-09","p":"R","v":290645,"s":72.49,"w":true,"n":"H. Morgan Griffith"},{"y":2022,"o":"H","k":"VA-09","p":"R","v":182207,"s":73.24,"w":true,"n":"H Morgan Griffith"},{"y":2020,"o":"H","k":"VA-09","p":"R","v":271851,"s":93.98,"w":true,"n":"H Morgan Griffith"},{"y":2018,"o":"H","k":"VA-09","p":"R","v":160933,"s":65.16,"w":true,"n":"H Morgan Griffith"},{"y":2016,"o":"H","k":"VA-09","p":"R","v":212838,"s":68.59,"w":true,"n":"H Morgan Griffith"},{"y":2014,"o":"H","k":"VA-09","p":"R","v":117465,"s":72.15,"w":true,"n":"H Morgan Griffith"},{"y":2012,"o":"H","k":"VA-09","p":"R","v":184882,"s":61.29,"w":true,"n":"H Morgan Griffith"},{"y":2010,"o":"H","k":"VA-09","p":"R","v":95726,"s":51.21,"w":true,"n":"H Morgan Griffith"}]}